  select id,'2026-06-29','69effdfb-6c59-4138-94a4-ea037030a1ec','raised','with_sponsor','Escalation: Off-Boarding: [HIGH risk] Director ill since March 2026. On 29 June 2026 he wrote asking for the programme to be put on hold until further notice, citing his health and an unstable business, and noted that cancellation may be necessary. UCA acknowledged on 16 July 2026 and confirmed it would action the off-boarding process. UCA had asked on 9 April, 26 May and 22 June whether a representative could be nominated; that remains unanswered. Mitigation: Request recorded and acknowledged. Off-boarding initiated by UCA. Now awaiting SBSA ESD confirmation of the off-boarding process before the beneficiary is removed from reporting and billing.' from e;

